# pnpm workspace-root config.
#
# `public-hoist-pattern[]=*` tells pnpm to symlink EVERY transitive
# dependency into the workspace-root `node_modules/`. This is required
# for the mobile (Expo / Metro) workspace because Metro's resolver
# only walks node_modules paths it's been told about — it can't follow
# pnpm's isolated `.pnpm/<pkg>/node_modules/` store.
#
# Concretely: expo-notifications has a transitive chain (@ide/backoff
# → assert → util → is-arguments → ...) of pure-JS Node-builtin
# polyfills. Adding each as a direct mobile dep is whack-a-mole;
# hoisting them once at the workspace root fixes the whole tree.
#
# The Next.js website workspace is unaffected — its bundler (Webpack
# in dev / Turbopack in prod) uses its own resolver that handles
# pnpm's strict layout natively.
public-hoist-pattern[]=*
